# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout.
# Windows checkouts were producing CRLF working trees, which polluted spec
# extraction (the round-trip gate reads source files byte-for-byte) and made
# every commit emit "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warnings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending processed. Playwright visual
# baselines in particular are byte-compared.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
